(6464850, 960962, 83313, '<td valign="top">Probably from <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=57447" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">npasel</a>, given the location. That requirement to give the location does kill the anonymity for some of us. Nice work with this one. Just enough tonemapping to give it some dimension and really nice visual pop.</td>', 'Probably from  npasel, given the location. That requirement to give the location does kill the anonymity for some of us. Nice work with this one. Just enough tonemapping to give it some dimension and really nice visual pop.', '2011-07-08 01:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
