(6464862, 960747, 83313, '<td valign="top">There''s something I like about those original style walk up McDonald''s. I see they have Speedy the hamburger guy on the billboard. I read that McDonald''s quit using him as a mascot early on because he looked too similar to Speedy the Alka-seltzer boy. Not a good association for them to be making.</td>', 'There''s something I like about those original style walk up McDonald''s. I see they have Speedy the hamburger guy on the billboard. I read that McDonald''s quit using him as a mascot early on because he looked too similar to Speedy the Alka-seltzer boy. Not a good association for them to be making.', '2011-07-08 01:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6464872, 960966, 114285, '<td valign="top">Loving that sky, this pops.</td>', 'Loving that sky, this pops.', '2011-07-08 01:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
