(6465984, 960655, 114225, '<td valign="top">That''s one good looking burger. I like the perspective, but there seems to be an odd yellow color cast caused by the lighting.</td>', 'That''s one good looking burger. I like the perspective, but there seems to be an odd yellow color cast caused by the lighting.', '2011-07-09 00:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6465985, 960756, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m really glad that you got this shot with activity in the building. That really adds to the story.</td>', 'I''m really glad that you got this shot with activity in the building. That really adds to the story.', '2011-07-09 00:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6466051, 960847, 103032, '<td valign="top">Pretty sweet pic of a diner.  I like how the chair backs are "uniform" in facing toward you (don''t know if it was happen stance or orchestrated...).  I like the composition of filling the frame (not much wasted space).  I like how the viewer is lead down the counter chairs to the table.  My pick of the challenge.  (Just curious though, maybe an outtake in color for comparison...)</td>', 'Pretty sweet pic of a diner.  I like how the chair backs are "uniform" in facing toward you (don''t know if it was happen stance or orchestrated...).  I like the composition of filling the frame (not much wasted space).  I like how the viewer is lead down the counter chairs to the table.  My pick of the challenge.  (Just curious though, maybe an outtake in color for comparison...)', '2011-07-09 03:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6466109, 960756, 81362, '<td valign="top">Enjoying the glimpses of action inside the place, adding additional interest to a good composition.</td>', 'Enjoying the glimpses of action inside the place, adding additional interest to a good composition.', '2011-07-09 06:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6466112, 960075, 81362, '<td valign="top">Classic place meeting challeng for content (perhaps not for the title instructions). Camera tilt seems artifical, calling attention to itself rather than making it dynamic (to my eyes) even though adding good diagonal elements. I wonder if a low to high vantage point, like through the eyes of a small child, would be an alternative approach.</td>', 'Classic place meeting challeng for content (perhaps not for the title instructions). Camera tilt seems artifical, calling attention to itself rather than making it dynamic (to my eyes) even though adding good diagonal elements. I wonder if a low to high vantage point, like through the eyes of a small child, would be an alternative approach.', '2011-07-09 06:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6466114, 960827, 81362, '<td valign="top">The somewhat excessive Topaz-like post processing lends a cartoon sensibility that actually isn''t so out of place for the setting. Including so many people is a good choice.</td>', 'The somewhat excessive Topaz-like post processing lends a cartoon sensibility that actually isn''t so out of place for the setting. Including so many people is a good choice.', '2011-07-09 06:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6466116, 960958, 81362, '<td valign="top">In thumbnails, this seemed too far off topic, but in voting, the larger semi-abstract effect is prety interesting.</td>', 'In thumbnails, this seemed too far off topic, but in voting, the larger semi-abstract effect is prety interesting.', '2011-07-09 06:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6466119, 960943, 81362, '<td valign="top">As a fan of abstracts, I give this a higher score than I''d expect from the rest of the voting crowd. Good for you for following your artistic vision.</td>', 'As a fan of abstracts, I give this a higher score than I''d expect from the rest of the voting crowd. Good for you for following your artistic vision.', '2011-07-09 06:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6466123, 960847, 81362, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challenge. The gleaming black and white conversion fits perfectly with "Silver", the composition is well-planned particularly with camera lower than stand-up height, and including a person lends interest.</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challenge. The gleaming black and white conversion fits perfectly with "Silver", the composition is well-planned particularly with camera lower than stand-up height, and including a person lends interest.', '2011-07-09 06:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6466125, 960062, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good colors and dynamic positioning. Too bad the people seem so disconnected (would rather see several going up the steps, but New York probably doesn''t make that easy to capture).</td>', 'Good colors and dynamic positioning. Too bad the people seem so disconnected (would rather see several going up the steps, but New York probably doesn''t make that easy to capture).', '2011-07-09 06:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
