(6466130, 960904, 81362, '<td valign="top">Good for including the entire sign and fitting in the horse figure. Could be stronger from a vantage point a bit to the left and closer -- to reduce the impact of the upright pole and to avoid the distracting traffic (if possible without getting run over!).</td>', 'Good for including the entire sign and fitting in the horse figure. Could be stronger from a vantage point a bit to the left and closer -- to reduce the impact of the upright pole and to avoid the distracting traffic (if possible without getting run over!).', '2011-07-09 06:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
