(6466985, 960770, 39880, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the lights.  Good perspective.  I think that if there were some cars or people this would add some more interest.</td>', 'Nice job on the lights.  Good perspective.  I think that if there were some cars or people this would add some more interest.', '2011-07-10 14:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
