(6467151, 960835, 135405, '<td valign="top">Just absolutely one helluva image--although I don''t think I''ll pay attention to the sign.</td>', 'Just absolutely one helluva image--although I don''t think I''ll pay attention to the sign.', '2011-07-10 20:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
