(6469849, 960847, 132996, '<td valign="top">I like this image. I think the composition is strong. The repeating chairs are very appealing and the slight grunge look caused by the grain is excellent. I think the contrast is a bit too strong, however. It''s a bit hard to see what''s happening beyond the chairs.</td>', 'I like this image. I think the composition is strong. The repeating chairs are very appealing and the slight grunge look caused by the grain is excellent. I think the contrast is a bit too strong, however. It''s a bit hard to see what''s happening beyond the chairs.', '2011-07-13 19:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6469851, 960837, 132996, '<td valign="top">I love this image...it has all the feel of an old-school family snapshot, the cut off at the knees, the pissed off look on the kid''s face. You shouldn''t have added the text though. :(</td>', 'I love this image...it has all the feel of an old-school family snapshot, the cut off at the knees, the pissed off look on the kid''s face. You shouldn''t have added the text though. :(', '2011-07-13 19:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
