(6471610, 960836, 61315, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on 3rd - this received my highest score so I''m glad you ribboned with it. I can''t believe anyone would score you down for the missing city/state. I thought that stipulation took away from the anonymity of the challenge so never even looked at the titles and didn''t know that portion of yours was missing! :-)<br/> <br/>The Woodie adds so much to the image - what good fortune it was parked there.</td>', 'Congratulations on 3rd - this received my highest score so I''m glad you ribboned with it. I can''t believe anyone would score you down for the missing city/state. I thought that stipulation took away from the anonymity of the challenge so never even looked at the titles and didn''t know that portion of yours was missing! :-) The Woodie adds so much to the image - what good fortune it was parked there.', '2011-07-15 15:39:50.000000', NULL, 0),
