(6472685, 960877, 37252, '<td valign="top">love the story you can think up....<br/>guy in foreground: "who the hell is this guy taking my picture? I''ll just pretend I don''t see him, read my paper, and hide behind my cigarette.<br/>younger couple in background: woman turns her back as she is camera shy. Husband gives the evil eye to the guy with the cigarette as he upset about the second hand smoke.<br/>older couple in background: old guy "dammit, maybe if I hunch over a bit and keep my shades on he won''t recognize me from the wanted poster in the post office. woman sips her coffee as she begins to raise paper up to help hide her felon husband.</td>', 'love the story you can think up....guy in foreground: "who the hell is this guy taking my picture? I''ll just pretend I don''t see him, read my paper, and hide behind my cigarette.younger couple in background: woman turns her back as she is camera shy. Husband gives the evil eye to the guy with the cigarette as he upset about the second hand smoke.older couple in background: old guy "dammit, maybe if I hunch over a bit and keep my shades on he won''t recognize me from the wanted poster in the post office. woman sips her coffee as she begins to raise paper up to help hide her felon husband.', '2011-07-16 20:39:53.000000', NULL, 0),
